{
  "esm": "2.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u",
    "description": "The raw east-face potential-vorticity flux of the SADOURNY75_ENERGY Coriolis scheme on the mom6_cgrid: pvf_u(i,j,k) = 0.25 * ((q(i,j,k)*(vh(i+1,j,k) + vh(i,j,k))) + (q(i,j-1,k)*(vh(i,j-1,k) + vh(i+1,j-1,k)))) * IdxCu(i,j), the CAu of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc :724-726 before the bound_coriolis clamp and the -KEx term, with q(i,j) the layer potential vorticity at the q-point at the NE corner of cell (i,j), vh the north-face layer volume fluxes of the two cells on each side of the east face (vh(i,j)/vh(i+1,j) the north faces of the cell and its east neighbour, vh(i,j-1)/vh(i+1,j-1) their south faces) and IdxCu(i,j) the east-face 1/length. Every region applies the one law mom6_sadourny_pvf with region bindings. SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES (a basin closed by land, MOM6's zero wall fluxes): at j = 1 the south faces vh(i,0)/vh(i+1,0) are the closed south wall, whose flux is 0, so the q(i,0) term vanishes (q_b, f_b1, f_b2 are bound to 0; the wall q-point is not stored and is multiplied only by zero fluxes) and pvf_u(i,1) = 0.25*((q(i,1)*(vh(i+1,1) + vh(i,1))) + 0)*IdxCu(i,1), an interior east face whose value MOM6 computes from the north-side term alone. At i = N_I the east face is the closed east wall itself and vh(N_I+1,*) are north faces of the land cell beyond it, flux 0, so f_a1 and f_b2 are bound to 0 (the literal MOM6 value at the wall face; the wall face's velocity is 0, so it never accelerates anything). The SE corner applies both. (Before this revision the wall regions copied the edge cell's own q/vh into the out-of-domain slots, double-counting the interior term on the whole j = 1 row of real faces.) The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_pvf_u(q, vh, IdxCu); the where clause requires q and vh to be [i,j,k] fields and IdxCu an [i,j] field (esm-spec 9.6.1).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:rule", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:pvf", "order:0", "bc:wall", "axes:i,j,k"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc SADOURNY75_ENERGY CAu at :722-727; the face conventions of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [{ "ref": "../grid.esm" }, { "ref": "../stencils/mom6_sadourny_pvf.esm" }],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u": {
      "params": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
      "match": { "op": "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u", "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"] },
      "where": { "q": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] }, "vh": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] }, "IdxCu": { "shape": ["i", "j"] } },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], [2, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [["N_I", "N_I"], [2, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [[1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], [1, 1], [1, "N_K"]],
          [["N_I", "N_I"], [1, 1], [1, "N_K"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], "j": [2, "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mom6_sadourny_pvf",
              "bindings": {
                "q_a": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "f_a1": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                "f_a2": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "q_b": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                "f_b1": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                "f_b2": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                "I_d": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxCu", "i", "j"] }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": { "i": ["N_I", "N_I"], "j": [2, "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mom6_sadourny_pvf",
              "bindings": {
                "q_a": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "f_a1": 0.0,
                "f_a2": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "q_b": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                "f_b1": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] },
                "f_b2": 0.0,
                "I_d": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxCu", "i", "j"] }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], "j": [1, 1], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mom6_sadourny_pvf",
              "bindings": {
                "q_a": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "f_a1": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                "f_a2": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "q_b": 0.0,
                "f_b1": 0.0,
                "f_b2": 0.0,
                "I_d": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxCu", "i", "j"] }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": { "i": ["N_I", "N_I"], "j": [1, 1], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mom6_sadourny_pvf",
              "bindings": {
                "q_a": { "op": "index", "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "f_a1": 0.0,
                "f_a2": { "op": "index", "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"] },
                "q_b": 0.0,
                "f_b1": 0.0,
                "f_b2": 0.0,
                "I_d": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxCu", "i", "j"] }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
